# --- SR investigation scratch files (2026-09-27 security review) -----------------------
# One-off scripts and JSON/PNG dumps pulled from CloudWatch/Salesforce while investigating
# individual SRs. These commonly contain customer PII (names, emails, phone numbers, DOB)
# and must NEVER be committed here — this repo is public on GitHub. If one is ever worth
# keeping permanently, `git add -f` it deliberately; don't loosen these patterns to "just
# commit one". Move investigation output to a location outside this repo instead.
/booking*.json
/block_*.json
/check-sr*.js
/check-payment*.js
/dump_*.js
/extract*.js
/find_*.js
/group-*.json
/parse*.js
/pax-to-cancel*
/pull-*.js
/repro-*
/rows_*.json
/sr[0-9]*.json
/sr[0-9]*.png
/summarize_*.js
/trace_*.js
/xlsx_extract/
# Personal, machine-specific files - never commit (versions.txt is a local inventory).
/versions.txt
/twg-install.ps1
